### 登录失败：message 是 key，不是中文
POST http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ada",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### 登录成功：教学口令 secret
POST http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ada",
  "password": "secret"
}

### 参数校验：用户名为空，message = common.param_invalid
POST http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "secret"
}

### 文件类型不允许
POST http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/files
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "note.exe"
}

### 允许的图片扩展名
POST http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/files
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "avatar.png"
}

### 对照：服务端按英文译出句子
GET http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/messages?key=auth.login.invalid_credentials
Accept-Language: en

### 对照：服务端按简体中文译出句子
GET http://localhost:8031/api/i18n/messages?key=file.type_not_allowed
Accept-Language: zh-CN
